(1. git init                      : Khoi tao mot Git repository trong thu muc hien tai.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(2. git clone <repo_url>          : Keo toan bo ma nguon va lich su commit tu GitHub ve may.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(3. git status                    : Kiem tra trang thai cac file: modified \(do\), staged \(xanh\).) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(4. git add <file> hoac git add . : Dua file da sua vao Staging Area de chuan bi dong goi.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(5. git commit -m "[msg]"         : Tao mot snapshot danh dau code, thong diep ro rang ngan gon.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(6. git push origin <branch>      : Day toan bo commit tu local len remote server \(GitHub/GitLab\).) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(7. git pull origin <branch>      : Keo va tu dong merge code moi nhat tu remote ve may local.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(8. git branch -a                 : Xem toan bo danh sach nhanh \(local va remote dang theo doi\).) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(9. git checkout -b <branch_name> : Tao ngay mot branch moi va nhay sang branch do de code.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
